{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_06_beg","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":12,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_05_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-6","storyName":"失路人","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"葬礼过后，帮助过拉芙希妮的“放逐王”再度现身，邀请她随自己见证王城遗迹深处的秘密。在那里，拉芙希妮直面塔拉历史覆辙的同时，也见证了“放逐王”自己的故事。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_06","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["拉芙希妮","严肃的守灵人","“放逐王”","担忧的居民","伤心的女孩"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_bg_59_g5_remains_outside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"所以，即便去城里不为别的，只为举行一场还火仪式，你们也仍然不愿意？","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"您所述的情况实在太过反常。仅凭您的言语，我们也无法确认城中居民的生与死。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"更不要说还火仪式只是葬礼罢了，请您不要抱不切实际的期望。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......那就请回吧，守灵人。无论如何，感谢你们的帮助。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"即便没有我们，您也要回纳斯尔纱去？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"莫兰他们如今融入得很好，我没什么可担心的，涅梅丝的托付也已经完成......","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我已经没有其他该做的事了。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"红龙阁下，请保重。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1691_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我会的。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":28},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":29},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":31},{"type":"text","text":"红龙迈步，独自向来时的方向继续前进。昨日种种，留到眼中仅余一簇微弱的影。","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"而那同样也是一簇小小的火。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“还火”......","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"下定决心回去送死了？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不知名的先生？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"您来得正好，我们得谈一谈。如果您愿意帮我——","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你有没有在你的红龙历史课上，听过一个叫拉布雷德的倒霉鬼的故事？","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"——先生？","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"哈，看来是没有了。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"出走多年以后第一次回到王城，还没见到他亲爱的胞弟，就被护卫领走，被利剑穿胸而死......","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不，我知道这段故事。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你也打算学他，做一个彻彻底底的蠢货，是吗？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"走吧。你见到了你姐姐，人到现在也都还活着，已经赢了那倒霉鬼太多，是不是？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"拉布雷德和艾里尔的故事并非我和爱布拉娜的故事。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"......哼，就当我是偏要把闲事管到底吧。你刚才不是想跟我谈谈吗？要谈什么？","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"城里的还火仪式。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我本来只想多找一个准备仪式的人，但您看起来对塔拉的历史掌故很了解，我想，也许您能为我提供一些帮助......","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"历史？掌故？","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"那我们不如边走边聊。走这边。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"可黑林在那边——","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"跟我走，就像在黑林里那次一样，听见了吗？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":72},{"type":"charslot","id":73},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_bg_34_g7_galekingruins.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":75},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":77},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......王城的遗址？","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我曾经来过这里。这里的源石多发环境并不安全——","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你不是要历史和掌故吗？找遍整个塔拉，还有哪个地方能比得上这座*古老的廷盖语粗口*王城？","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这座什么样的王城？","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"嘁，没什么。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我始终感激那时您在黑林提供的帮助，可现在我的确也有更要紧的事，没有太多时间——","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"有什么事？送死？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你和你姐姐还真是大不相同。那条红龙的火焰受了诅咒，可性格再典型不过，目空一切，再听不见别的声音。你倒好——","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我和姐姐原本就不同，但她也并不是您说的这样。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"可无论你们如何不同，红龙的天性都是斗争，即使你只是被卷入的那个也一样。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"而斗争从来都只有一种结果，你死，或是她亡。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"所以说，反正有一个人要死，为什么要着急呢？","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"再多点耐心吧，年轻人。我们就快到了。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"charslot","id":109},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F7/Avg_bg_34_g8_galekingruins_inside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":113},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"我们今天来这儿就是为了这个祭台。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"祭台？您是说中间的那个吗？可那不是......熔炉吗？","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“熔融了所有塔拉战士的武器、颠覆了王朝命运的熔炉”......令死去的战士从中复生的熔炉。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"哈，现在你们都这么称呼它？神神道道的，听起来倒是比“祭台”厉害不少。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"但很可惜，祭台就是祭台，只不过比其他祭台庞大。王城的核心就围着它建立，盖尔王加冕时的仪式石阵即是它的前身。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"而老红龙死去的时候，人们也会在这里为他还火。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"还火？","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"就跟你在那群木头脑袋那儿看见的东西一样。这么多年了，他们倒真是一直记得清清楚楚。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"不过，那年头的还火可不是点起篝火就了事的。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"梅里亚德那老女人的时候，继承盖尔王之位的红龙的兄弟姐妹，只要把手伸进火里烫几个泡就结了。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"不过再往上追溯，据说，只是据说，很久很久以前，那些兄弟姐妹都要一起在火里殉葬。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"看，你的脸色越来越糟了。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"charslot","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"他扬起手，一簇紫火从他的袖口汇入祭台中跳动着的，同样是紫色的火苗。","id":142},{"type":"text","text":"火焰安稳地呼吸，仿佛婴孩卧在母亲的襁褓之中。","id":143},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"您的火也是紫色？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不对，您是德拉克......难道您是——","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"唯独在这件事上你迟钝得出奇，但现在你已经逃不掉了。把手放进来。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4D/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"您？！","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你不是想让纳斯尔纱还火吗？想，就把手放进来。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"红龙于是沉默。她伸出手，触碰熔炉中的火苗——那火一如既往地并不温暖，却也出乎意料地算不上冰冷。","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"现在我能告诉你，带你来这儿，是为让你看清——","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"塔拉如今的悲剧，红龙长久以来的污名......一切不过始于重蹈命运残忍的覆辙。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"我和你的好姐姐同为喷吐死火的异种，而我现在已经不愿，也无法再对死者有分毫不敬，不过是带你看看在这片土地上死去的人......","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"他们的命运罢了。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.4","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"fire","id":171},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.1","channel":"fire","fadetime":"2","id":172},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_deathburning","layer":"1","id":173},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_59_i05.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"subtitle","text":"要从这里开始吗？这算是最近头一桩大事了，也可以理解。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":178},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你那好姐姐是对的。沾上了死火的东西无药可救，只是这火本来不该这么容易蔓延。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":179},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我倒一直好奇，究竟是多大的怨恨，才能让德拉克六百年后再次诞下不祥的异种？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":180},{"type":"subtitle","id":181},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":182},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"charslot","id":186},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_59_i04.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"subtitle","text":"哦，然后是他。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":191},{"type":"subtitle","text":"要我说，他醒得太晚了，太阳都要落山，他才从床上爬起来，只能理所当然地沦为牺牲品。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":192},{"type":"subtitle","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......即使是您，也请不要这样轻描淡写地带过死亡，不要用牺牲的名义将它合理化。","id":194},{"type":"dialog","id":195},{"type":"subtitle","text":"那也许只是因为你见的还不够多。要是习惯了，忍一忍就过去了——","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":196},{"type":"subtitle","text":"看，另一个牺牲品来了。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":197},{"type":"subtitle","id":198},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":200},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":201},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":202},{"type":"charslot","id":203},{"type":"image","id":204},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F8/Avg_bg_59_g10_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":206},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"杀死你的维多利亚人，他们已经被赶跑了！","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"就连最后那个维多利亚坏种，也已经在我眼前......死掉了......","id":210},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"subtitle","text":"不得不说，你姐姐的愿景某种意义上的确化为现实了。塔拉人站起，维多利亚人倒下。简单，直接，“大快人心”。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":213},{"type":"subtitle","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"您也是......袖手旁观的其中一员？","id":215},{"type":"dialog","id":216},{"type":"subtitle","text":"别钻牛角尖了，小崽子。都到这份上了，你知道我是什么。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":217},{"type":"subtitle","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":220},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"charslot","id":223},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_58_mini01.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我可没见过这场面。给我介绍一下？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":228},{"type":"subtitle","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......这是一场战争。","id":230},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"subtitle","text":"战争不计其数，你得说得更明白点。她烧死的是哪家仇敌，目光望向的又是哪片土地？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":232},{"type":"subtitle","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"维多利亚。爱布拉娜要将塔拉的权柄自阿斯兰手中夺回。这就是那场战争的尾声。","id":234},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"subtitle","text":"阿斯兰？那伙自诩与众不同的混球？可她面对的难道不是萨卡兹吗？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":236},{"type":"subtitle","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":238},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"subtitle","text":"算了。原来是狮子抢走了维多利亚，我知道这一点就够了。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":240},{"type":"subtitle","id":241},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"charslot","id":246},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_21_I5.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":250},{"type":"subtitle","text":"就算你不说，我也知道这是什么。就像即使被面具遮盖，我也猜得到那下面的表情。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":251},{"type":"subtitle","text":"只有在面对已成定局的死亡时，红龙脸上才会出现的......得偿所愿的满足与狂喜。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":252},{"type":"subtitle","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不......那不是喜悦，那是和喜悦背道而驰的——","id":254},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"subtitle","text":"背道而驰？怕不是那时你受伤太重，已经开始在临死前美化看见的一切了吧。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":256},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我说过了，这不过是重蹈覆辙，城市骑上了轮子，国度更换了主人，但内里的东西别无二致。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":257},{"type":"subtitle","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":260},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_34_i11.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这是哪里？是你们的家吗？是你们学着怎样对彼此刀剑相向的地方？这个人又是谁？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":268},{"type":"subtitle","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"沃里克伯爵，我与爱布拉娜的收养者。","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"爱布拉娜说他使塔拉人看到了希望，能看见，却永远无法抵达，将渴水的旅人用幻景逼入疯癫。这就是他所做的一切。","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"他手握那条纤细的丝线，而丝线连接的两头，一方是终于找回名姓的塔拉人，一方是长久立于上位的压迫者。","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......那条线就是姐姐和我。","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"现在想来......他或许正是第一个身染紫火之人。","id":274},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":277},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":278},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"charslot","id":280},{"type":"image","id":281},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":282},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","channel":"fire","fadetime":"2","id":283},{"type":"bgeffect","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":285},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fire","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"......哈。","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你不仅同情你姐姐，而且还相当理解她。怪不得你不愿杀死她。","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"但我绝不会成为她，也不会选择引颈就戮。","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_bg_59_g14_galekingruins_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"您让我回溯这一连串的事件，或者说历史，究竟想向我证明什么？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"证明塔拉的历史就是旧日废墟的不断堆叠与组合，你见过的东西，我也已经见过，从中已经无法发掘任何新的事物。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"可我看到的不是废墟，而是......火焰的根源。","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"纳斯尔纱城内的火的确是姐姐的火，但也同样是那些血腥背后，庞大而无处安放的悲伤。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"是战争......不，是从战争之前很久就开始的那些痛苦，那些压迫，那些被夺走的东西，点燃了人们心中的火。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"在姐姐的塑造之下，那些悲伤化为仇恨，烧遍了塔拉的原野，赶走了维多利亚人。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"到了现在，悲伤已经无从用复仇掩盖，于是那火只好烧灼人们自己，将他们燃尽，成为一具又一具行尸走肉。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"不错的总结，小崽子，可你真觉得，只是一场还火，就能解决城里的一切吗？","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我面前只有这一条路。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"的确，但这条路到底该如何踏上去呢？","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"过来。你的事看完了，还有我的呢。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"charslot","id":317},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.4","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":318},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_bg_38_g21_skystarry_R1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"（古老的廷盖语）别哭，别哭了。不就是一只云兽吗？","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伤心的女孩","text":"（古老的廷盖语）可灰爪是我从小喂大的......","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伤心的女孩","text":"（古老的廷盖语）爸爸，人们都说你的火焰不一样，你不能医治活着的人，却能让死去的人回来......","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"（古老的廷盖语）那不是回来，那只是空壳。","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伤心的女孩","text":"（古老的廷盖语）就算是空壳也好，爸爸，求你了，我只想再听听灰爪的叫声......","id":327},{"type":"dialog","id":328},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":330},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"subtitle","text":"性情冲动的红龙就这样败在小女儿的请求之下。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":332},{"type":"subtitle","text":"于是，数月之后，不仅云兽，整片牧场的兽群都出现异象。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":333},{"type":"subtitle","text":"驮兽不吃草，瘤兽不产奶，老去的迟迟不死，新生的频频夭折，甚至还有剃光了肉的骨架在草场上徘徊......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":334},{"type":"subtitle","text":"紫火在兽群间蔓延，红龙不得不带着族人离开那片牧场。在他不算太长的一生中，这样的错误，他犯过许多次。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":335},{"type":"subtitle","id":336},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_bg_59_g5_remains_outside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":338},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"紫火......沾染兽群？","id":341},{"type":"dialog","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":344},{"type":"subtitle","text":"兽群又怎样？你的好姐姐竟敢用这火去烧灼死去的人，这才真正叫人瞠目结舌。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":345},{"type":"subtitle","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"那这火焰最终到底是怎样熄灭的？","id":347},{"type":"dialog","id":348},{"type":"charslot","id":349},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......接下来，你会知道的。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":350},{"type":"subtitle","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_bg_59_g12_castlecorridor_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这里是......纳斯尔纱的堡垒？那条长廊？","id":359},{"type":"dialog","id":360},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"subtitle","text":"错，但错不在你。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":362},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我们只是向过去跨了一大步，这就是你脚下的王城......六百多年前的样子。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":363},{"type":"subtitle","text":"几百年后的石匠能将王城原有的样子搬上你们所谓的“纳斯尔纱”，这是唯一让我吓了一跳的事情。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":364},{"type":"subtitle","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这里......发生了什么？","id":366},{"type":"dialog","id":367},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这里......哈......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":368},{"type":"subtitle","id":369},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"0.5","id":370},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","id":371},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2.5","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":373},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"charslot","id":376},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_59_i07.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"text","text":"愚蠢的拉布雷德犯了太多次你见过的错误，他逐渐变得虚弱，觉得自己大限将至。","id":378},{"type":"text","text":"于是，在夏末节前夕，他临时起意，带着游牧生活能让他备好的最上等的礼物，只为了见阔别二十年的弟弟一面。","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"他甚至说动了城中掌管祭典仪式的祭司们，让他们向弟弟引见自己。","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"祭司们被他的思念之情打动，带他进入城中，可不知何时，带他的人的声音、身形、态度，好像全变了。","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"然后，他被带到这条长廊——","id":382},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":384},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_dooropen","volume":"1","id":385},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_battlepresent","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0.3","id":386},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","duration":"45","block":"false","id":387},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":389},{"type":"text","text":"我猜下令诛杀兄长的艾里尔并不在大门另一头的阳台上，因为就算我到死也睁着眼，还是没能从那缝隙之中瞧见他的火。","id":390},{"type":"text","text":"究竟是哪里出了差错？","id":391},{"type":"text","text":"是城中祭司仍以对待王族的态度待我便使他愠怒，还是我一声不响二十余年的远离早已令他深觉背叛？","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"又或者......想要杀死我的另有其人，他只是不得不照做？","id":393},{"type":"text","text":"我无从知晓。","id":394},{"type":"text","text":"在这场短暂而迅速的围杀中，唯有一件事是我早已了解，且深信不疑的——","id":395},{"type":"text","text":"红龙永不原谅。红龙的恨意比塔拉的历史更长。","id":396},{"type":"dialog","id":397},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"3","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":400},{"type":"charslot","id":401},{"type":"image","id":402},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_bg_59_g14_galekingruins_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":405},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":406},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"可我要告诉你的还不止这些。","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"我死后，艾里尔指使手下将我的棺椁在王城中拖行，向每个人展示我的下场。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"于是，每一处我曾带族人停留过的牧场都燃起熊熊紫火，凡沾染了那火的，生命无不背弃，只留死亡占据。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"七日之后，祭司们在黑林外一处旷野上为我还火，直到他们还给我的火焰熄灭，牧场上的紫火才缓缓退去。","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"也是到那个时候，我死后一直在火中残存的那点意识才彻底没入黑暗。","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"而那些沾染了火的生灵，无论野兽还是人类......统统化为灰烬。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你姐姐没有骗你。她不死，这火焰只会继续蔓延下去。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"可她又是一条再典型不过的红龙，她才不会高尚到为了拯救那些还没活下来的人丢掉性命。她让你回去，其中不可能没有陷阱。","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"所以，跑，去求助，去呼喊，去让与她旗鼓相当的对手扑灭这不知会蔓延到何时的火，这就是你唯一的办法。","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"可如果她已经认定，只有我有资格做她旗鼓相当的舞伴呢？","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"可如果我只是无法放着那一城或许还有救的生命不管呢？","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"所以，你就要去给一个活着的人还火？","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"没错。","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"那要是给活人还火没用呢？","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1A/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"无论如何，我都会回去。","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":436},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#12$2","focus":"none","id":441},{"type":"text","text":"良久，拉芙希妮只听见一声叹息。","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"（古老的廷盖语）愚蠢和倔强还真是代代相传。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4D/Avg_avg_npc_1690_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":445},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":446},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":448},{"type":"charslot","id":449},{"type":"background","id":450},{"type":"image","id":451}],"characters":["拉芙希妮","严肃的守灵人","“放逐王”","担忧的居民","伤心的女孩"]}